# API host (`Challingo.Api`)

- `Program.cs` loads `.env` via DotNetEnv when present.
- `DependencyInjection.cs` registers DbContext, repositories, services.
- Controllers inherit `AppController`.
- Swagger documents `AppResponse` envelope.
- Redis / SignalR: `AddScaffoldRedis()` + `AddScaffoldRealtime()` (Extensions/RealtimeExtensions.cs), hub mapped by `MapScaffoldRealtime()`. Push via `IRealtimeNotifier`, rank via `ILeaderboardStore`.
